  "description": "A modern .NET SDK for WayForPay payment gateway integration. Supports all major operations including Purchase, Charge, Refund, Settlement, and Status checks. Compatible with .NET 8.0, 9.0, and 10.0.",
  "id": "WayForPaySDK",
