  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.3.0 — MMS Marketplace API:\n• New IMmsClient interface with 6 MMS operations (addPartner, partnerInfo, updatePartner, addMerchant, merchantInfo, merchantBalance)\n• Separate MmsClient for /mms/{operation}.php endpoints with HMAC-MD5 signatures\n• Partner management: register, query info, update contacts and compensation details\n• Merchant management: create merchants, query info, check UAH balance\n• Compensation support: card (number/token) and IBAN (account/MFO/OKPO)\n• Automatic DI registration via AddWayForPay() — registers both IWayForPayClient and IMmsClient\n• Base classes: MmsRequest, MmsResponse, CompensatedMmsRequest\n• Internal: ApiUrlBuilder shared utility, extracted HttpClient DI helper\n• Source-generated JSON for all 12 new request/response types\n• 33 new unit tests (requests, responses, client integration with WireMock)",
